tcspecial-doc: third-party notices

This package holds TCSpecial's manuals and design documents: HTML pages,
SVG diagrams and PNG screenshots. Nothing in it is compiled, and it holds
no third party's code, so it owes no third party a notice.

Each page embeds the stylesheet of Docutils, which formats it. Its author,
David Goodger, has placed it in the public domain, as the stylesheet says.
